Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
Opt-in MACHO_USE_LOAD_COMMANDS=yes resolves actual per-architecture imports from
local runpaths for checks and metadata, without rewriting upstream binaries.
Unresolved inherited runpaths fail explicitly in this mode.
The default pkgsrc path remains unchanged.
